    Add a disabled inherited-state USB host node alongside disabled Ethernet.
    Control/bulk only. A failed halt after DMA publication panics before any
    DMA-buffer reclamation. No physical USB or Wi-Fi acceptance is implied.
+
+config NT98513_MMC_BOARD
+ bool "Experimental NT98513 board with disabled SD PIO hosts"
+ depends on NT98513_USB_HOST_BOARD && MMC_NT98513
+ default n
+ help
+   Add two disabled native SD PIO nodes using the same shared clock owner.
+   Card power/pads and physical exclusive ownership require independent
+   qualification. No socket mapping, electrical timing or storage test is implied.
